    "detailed_description": "Embark on a dangerous journey through the wilderness, searching for the Little Wing, who perches atop the Mountain - in this challenging and charming platformer. Brave levels with many dangers, with tight and precise jumping, stamina management and attacks, can you find the Little Wing?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA single-player adventure with charming world and characters, tight platforming ripe for Speedrunning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMultiple landscapes and difficult levels await, becoming increasingly difficult as you near and ascend the mountain.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe controls are simple with options for Keyboard and Mouse or a Controller. Find your way using: jump, double-jump, and pull up over ledges. Attack enemies using a bow or Tomahawk and gather food to replenish your stamina.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuick gameplay and respawns keep you engaged and always moving.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you make it to the peak of the Little Wing? Good luck, and enjoy the journey.",
